    "chunk_size_bytes": 1936,
    "chunk_text": "The Government of Sri Lanka, within the joint Cabinet Sub-Committee appointed by His Excellency the President, will therefore closely study the European Commission report and consider ways and means of addressing the issues in our continuing pursuance of securing the GSP Plus facility.\n\nThank you.\n\n2009 \u0d94\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dd9\u0dad\u0ddd\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca 21 639 640\n\n*\u0dc3\u0db7\u0dcf\u0dd9\u0db8\u0dca\u0dc3\u0dba \u0db8\u0dad \u0dad\u0db6\u0db1 \u0dbd\u0daf \u0db4\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dc1\u0dba \u0dc3\u0dc4 \u0daf\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dad\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dbb\u0dd3\u0dd9\u0db8\u0dca \u0dc3\u0da7\u0dc4\u0dd9\u0db1\u0dca \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3\u0dca :\n\n*\u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0baa\u0bc0\u0b9f\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0bc8\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f \u0b95\u0bc2\u0bb1\u0bcd\u1fa0\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b95\u0bc1\u0bb1\u0bbf\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bcd \u0baa\u0b95\u0bc1\u0ba4\u0bbf\u1f9c\u0bae\u0bcd: Statement and portions of the Briefing Note tabled: Hon Members, we continue to engage the International community on a range of issues of mutual concern relating to the IDPs, resettlement and livelihood projects.\n\nOur engagement has included a series of meetings and interactions both in Sri Lanka and overseas, of which I informed the Hon. Members on 08th October, 2009. The interactions are beginning to show some acknowledgement of the improvements.\n\nFor instance, the British Foreign Secretary, David Miliband, speaking in the House of Commons on 13th October, 2009, acknowledged the improvement of sanitation facilities and cases of malnutrition having markedly decreased in the welfare centres for the internally displaced.\n\nHowever, there were concerns expressed and notwithstanding, some countries do continue to express concern on a range of issues relating to the IDP facilities.\n\nFrom my perspective, there is clearly a need for a greater degree of understanding by those countries which do not appreciate wholly the challenges faced by Sri Lanka in the aftermath of over three decades of brutal terrorism. Hence, our engagement has sought to secure a greater appreciation of these challenges and tangible assistance to address the very issues which mutually concern us."
  },
