    "chunk_text": "The Note from the Directorate General for Trade of the European Commission forwarding the EC report to the Mission of Sri Lanka in Brussels stated, \u201cThe Commission will now decide whether to propose a temporary withdrawal of the special incentive arrangement for sustainable development and good governance provided for under\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0 641 642\n\n\u0dc3\u0db7\u0dcf\u0dd9\u0db8\u0dca\u0dc3\u0dba \u0db8\u0dad \u0dad\u0db6\u0db1 \u0dbd\u0daf \u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dbd\u0dd2: \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0baa\u0bc0\u0b9f\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0bc8\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f \u0b86\u0bb5\u0ba3\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd : Documents tabled:\n\nBriefing Note on the Outcome of the Visit by Members of the Indian Parliament from the Constituencies in the State of Tamil Nadu H.E. President Mahinda Rajapaksa extended an invitation to the Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu, Hon. M. Karunanidhi on 11th June 2009 requesting the Chief Minister to \u201c\u2026 consider sending a delegation of your choice\u201d. The President added \u201cthe delegation would be able to ascertain at first-hand for themselves, developments in all parts of our country\u201d. Subsequently, the Government of India and the Government of the State of Tamil Nadu arranged in liaison with the Sri Lankan authorities for the visit to take place from 10th -14th October 2009. The composition of the delegation was:\n\n1. Mr. T.R. Baalu, former Indian Minister for Shipping and Transport and DMK Parliamentary Group Leader in the Lok Sabha (Lower House) 2. Mr. A.K.S. Vijayan, DMK MP in the Lok Sabha 3. Mr. T.K.S. Elangovan, DMK Lok Sabha MP 4. Ms. J. Helen Davidson, DMK Lok Sabha MP 5. Ms. Kanimozhi Karunanidhi, DMK Rajya Sabha MP (Upper House) and daughter of Hon. M. Karunanidhi, Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu 6. Mr. Thol. Thirumaavalavan, Viduthalai Chiruthaikal Katchchi (VCK) Lok Sabha MP 7. Mr. N.S.V. Chitthan, Congress Lok Sabha MP\n\n8. Mr. S. Alagiri, Congress Lok Sabha MP 9. Dr. E.M. Sudarsana Nachiappan, Congress Rajya Sabha MP 10. Mr. J.M. Haroon Rashid, Congress Lok Sabha"
