    "md5": "8475ca8eee2e13a433b1c9b75e9efe8b",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2177,
    "chunk_text": "I now get on to the projects under the Ministry of Nation Building and Estate Infrastructure Development. Sir, I find that most of the projects such as NECORD, NECCDEP, NEHRP are coming to an end within the next few months. But, this is the time opportune for them to do a good job of work in our areas because now only the people are being resettled there. Therefore, the Government, especially the Ministry of Nation Building\n\nThe third matter on which I want to speak is about a project where I was employed. Earlier, it was called \"NEIAP\" and now they call it \"Re-awakening Project\". As you know this was a very good project. When I was working in this project, a team of officials - experts from the World Bank along with the Residential Representative of the World Bank - used to inspect the worksite every six months and they did monitor the project. If there were any lapses or shortcomings, they took immediate action to rectify it. We, as workers of that project, were on pins those days. But, now the NEIAP is not active as in those days. I read in one of the newspapers, that this project has contributed much towards the development of agriculture in the Eastern region as well as in the Northern region. Mr. Deputy Chairman, I am very much disappointed about the present situation. I am sorry that the Hon. Minister concerned is not here now. When I spoke to him before, he said that he would organize a meeting to review the progress of this \"Re-awakening Project\", but so far it has not been done. I checked up from the Secretary to the Ministry of Nation Building and Estate Infrastructure Development and he said that he would organize a progress review meeting in Colombo but I suggested that it should be held in Batticaloa because only then we can achieve some good results. Sir, these are the matters I want to bring to your notice.\n\nThank you very much. [\u0d85. \u0db7\u0dcf. 1.17] \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dd9\u0dbb\u0ddd\u0dc4\u0dab \u0daf\u0dd2\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0db1\u0dcf\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0d82\u0dc0\u0dbb\u0dca\u0db0\u0db1 \u0d85\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dad\u0255\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf)\n\n(\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u1f97\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bc7\u0bb0\u0bbe\u0bb9\u0ba3 \u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb8\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95 - \u0ba8\u0b95\u0bb0 \u0b85\u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb5\u0bbf\u1f9e\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf \u0b85\u0bc8\u0bae\u0b9a\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bb0\u0bcd )"
