    "chunk_text": "With regard to politicizing the Police Department, I would like to invite your attention to the Provincial Coun-cil Election of the Western Province. The so-called Mou-lavis, the so-called former Members of Parliament who came on the National List and who have no ward base were advisers to the President and some people were sent to Maligawatta with the intention of terrorizing the area.\n\nThe police has become a part of State terrorism. The police officers are not doing their work properly, allowing themselves to be politicized. Most of them are concerned about their own promotions, double saluting and double summersaulting in front of all politicians. Politicians must not be allowed to give promotions and transfers. Therefore, with due respect, I would like to invite your attention to the fact that there should be a code of conduct with regard to law enforcement.\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dd9\u0db8\u0ddc\u0dd9\u0dc4\u0ddc\u0db8\u0da9\u0dca \u0dc2\u0dc6\u0dd3\u0d9a\u0dca \u0dbb\u0dcf\u0da2\u0db6\u0dca\u0daf\u0dd3\u0db1\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf]\n\n2009 \u0dd9\u0db1\u0ddc\u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca 06 1199 1200\n\nI must also remind you that we supported the extension of the state of Emergency. We support the extension of the state of Emergency, but what has happened? With our sup-port to its extension, extrajudicial killings of our people have taken place. Therefore, it must be properly administered. Venerable Presiding Member, I thank you very much for giving me the opportunity to speak a few words on this De-bate. Assalamu Alaikum!\n\n[\u0baa\u0bbf.\u0baa. 4.27] \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d91\u0db8\u0dca. \u0d91\u0dc3\u0dca. \u0dd9\u0dc3\u0dbd\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db8\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0dad\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dd0\u0dbd\u0dca \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0255 \u0d85\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dad\u0255\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf)"
  },
