    "chunk_text": "I must also remind you that we supported the extension of the state of Emergency. We support the extension of the state of Emergency, but what has happened? With our sup-port to its extension, extrajudicial killings of our people have taken place. Therefore, it must be properly administered. Venerable Presiding Member, I thank you very much for giving me the opportunity to speak a few words on this De-bate. Assalamu Alaikum!\n\n[\u0baa\u0bbf.\u0baa. 4.27] \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d91\u0db8\u0dca. \u0d91\u0dc3\u0dca. \u0dd9\u0dc3\u0dbd\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db8\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0dad\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dd0\u0dbd\u0dca \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0255 \u0d85\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dad\u0255\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf)"
