    "chunk_size_bytes": 856,
    "chunk_text": "coordination of the Vice President. Sri Lanka is actively participating at the Working Group Meeting, which is currently taking place in the backdrop of the 64th General Assembly Session of the United Nations, with a view to having the proceedings expedited. Sri Lanka is continuing its efforts in order to consult like-minded developing States with a view to finding ways and means to expedite the process. To summarize, let me therefore say the following:\n\nThank you, Sir.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dd2 \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u1f97\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb0\u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u1f9e\u0ba3\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) Mr. Speaker, I appreciate the convoluted answer that has been presented to the House, but I must say one thing. That is, this is basically contradictory to the first\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0 1295 1296"
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_hansard_2000s",
    "doc_id": "2009-11-17-2009-11-17",
