    "chunk_text": "But now with the elections in the offing, at least I hope that there will be a little more seriousness and that you will not fail in your duty to ensure that these people are not deprived any longer of their lands on which they would like to reside, on which they have lived for generations and centuries and on which they must carry on their cultivation and their occupation.\n\n\u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd6\u0daa \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0ba4\u0bc8\u0bb2\u0bc8\u0bae\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b89\u1fa0\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Presiding Member)\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da7 \u0dd9\u0dc0\u0db1\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dbb \u0d87\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dba \u0d85\u0dc0\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dba\u0dd2.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d86\u0dbb\u0dca. \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dca\u0db4\u0db1\u0dca\u0daf\u0db1\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u1f97\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b86\u0bb0\u0bcd. \u0b9a\u0bae\u0bcd\u0baa\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0ba9\u0bcd) (The Hon. R. Sampanthan)\n\nNo, Venerable Presiding Member, I have got time. I will take my Party\u2019s time. We have been urging that they must get back to the situation which prevailed prior to 1983 and there is no need for these camps now that the war has come to an end. The Tamil people must have the freedom to live with dignity as free citizens. The Sri Lankan State should not treat them like second-class citizens. But, what is happening today? I am told that along the A-9 road - one does not see this publicly when one travels on the A-9 road - a little distance inside, army camps are being established. It is also happening on the A-32 road between Poonarin and Mulangavil, some distance away from the road, army camps are being established. In a village called Kavtharimunai, a big army camp has been established recently. Why are you doing these things? Is this the reason why you are keeping INGOs out of these areas? Is this the reason why you do not want foreign governments to come and help the people living in those areas? Is it the position that you feel that if INGOs and foreign governments get involved in resettling people, in rehabilitating these people, these things will come to light? Large extents of land are being\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0 1575 1576"
  },
