    "chunk_text": "\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0 1575 1576\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dd9\u0db1\u0ddd \u0d9c\u0dd9\u0db1\u0dca\u0dc2\u0db1\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u1f97\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bae\u0bc7\u0ba9\u0bbe \u0b95\u0bc7\u0ba3\u0b9a\u0ba9\u0bcd) (The Hon. Mano Ganesan)\n\nThat is exactly what China is doing in Tibet. \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d86\u0dbb\u0dca. \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dca\u0db4\u0db1\u0dca\u0daf\u0db1\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u1f97\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b86\u0bb0\u0bcd. \u0b9a\u0bae\u0bcd\u0baa\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0ba9\u0bcd) (The Hon. R. Sampanthan)\n\nThe simple question is this. Are you prepared even after the war is over to ensure that there is only civilian rule in the North-East, in which the Tamil-speaking people in the North-East - the Tamils and the Muslims - have an adequate role to play in such a civilian rule or, is it your position that even though the war is over, you want to have military rule in the North-East and keep the Tamil people in particular, completely under military control? This is a very crucial question that the Government must be prepared to answer. Are you prepared to concede that there must be, in the North-East, a civilian rule in which the Tamil-speaking people should have an adequate and effective role or, is it your position that even though you may have won the war, you want to keep the Tamil-speaking people, the Tamil people in particular, under your complete military control and continue to humiliate them, continue to harass them, continue to insult them? I do not think, Venerable Presiding Member, this situation can continue. Particularly with the information that is now available to us in regard to further militarization, construction of further camps and the involvement of the Chinese Government in assisting the Sri Lankan"
