    "chunk_text": "Today, the entire Debate centered round one key element - democracy. I appreciate that. Why has the forthcoming Presidential Election of 2010 become so much of an issue? Today, under the leadership of President Mahinda Rajapaksa, we are for the first time witnessing a country free of terror and full of liberty. So much so, all the political forces, both on the Government side as well as on the Opposition, have the benefit of enjoying tranquility in terms of a settled environment, a normal environment - an environment in which political parties can actively participate in a very important election for our country. That election is second to none other election in this country. It is an important election for all our communities, for the entire nation. As the Foreign Minister, I must share with every one of you the importance the foreign community attaches to this Presidential Election that will be held for the first time in a free Sri Lanka.\n\nThen comes the JVP. There again, they have not won a Presidential Election. The statistics of the Provincial Council Elections of 2008-2009 clearly show where they stand in terms of the national electorate. So, there is no issue with regard to the JVP. They must get themselves attached to anyone who comes forward as a Presidential candidate and we wish them well.\n\nBut, the issue here is, the UNP. The UNP has no candidate and today they have a joint candidate or whom we term as a candidate who has been proposed -\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd3\u0dc0\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dca (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u1f97\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b89\u1fa0\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b92\u1f9e\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd) (An Hon. Member)\n\nA common candidate. \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dd9\u0dbb\u0ddd\u0dc4\u0dd2\u0dad \u0dd9\u0db6\u0ddd\u0dd9\u0d9c\u0ddc\u0dbd\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0d9c\u0db8 \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u1f97\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bc7\u0bb0\u0bbe\u0bb9\u0bbf\u0ba4 \u0bc7\u0baa\u0bbe\u0bc6\u0b95\u0bbe\u0bb2\u0bcd\u0bb2\u0bbe\u0b95\u0bae) (The Hon. Rohitha Bogollagama)"
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_hansard_2000s",
