    "chunk_text": "The major obstacle to development and security of the State was the separatist violence of the LTTE, which has now been destroyed by an effective political leadership provided by His Excellency the President. No armed force, whatever its experience and capacity, cannot achieve much without an effective and committed political leadership and this thesis was proved during the Second World War as well. Today, the conflict, which destabilized the country for more than 30 years, has come to an end and a new political situation has arisen as an aspect of the aftermath of the conflict which, in fact, was the sole cause for instability in this country. It was expected that the post-conflict political scenario after three decades of destruction and devastation of the national assets of this country would be used for the reconstruction of a great new society for Sri Lanka.\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0 1623 1624"
