    "md5": "0754ece8d21cb75b1345ab479ed45efd",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 789,
    "chunk_text": "Who is promoting Fonseka, who before the war, was totally an unknown entity in this country? He was only a soldier with an attractive military garb. I can compare him with one of those strutting soldiers of Adolf Hitler. He needs to be compared with one of those strutting soldiers with those high boots, who has been jumping up and down during the Hitler\u2019s regime, who, as the history of the Holocaust mentions, killed millions of Jews in the world.\n\nBefore I come to the other partner of the Front, the JVP, I would like to analyze some of the political slogans of the UNP. Firstly, they want to restore democracy. Let\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dcf\u0da0\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dba \u0da9\u0db6\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dca. \u0d92. \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dca\u0dc0\u0dcf \u0dc0\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dab\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbd \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf]\n\n2009 \u0dd9\u0daf\u0dc3\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca 08 1625 1626"
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_hansard_2000s",
